  "body": "11/933 East Coast Road | 3 Bedrooms | 2.5 Bathrooms | Sea Views\r\n\r\nWhy settle for ordinary when you can have something special?\r\n\r\nWake up to sea views, enjoy your own private space, and embrace effortless modern living in this beautifully designed brand-new home.\r\n\r\nTHE DIFFERENCE IS IN THE DETAILS:\r\n\r\n  - 3 spacious bedrooms\r\n  - 2.5 stylish bathrooms\r\n  - Beautiful sea views from both the living area and bedroom\r\n  - Cleverly designed layout offering privacy and separation\r\n  - Perfect lock-and-leave lifestyle\r\n  - Brand-new construction with 10-year Stamford warranty\r\n\r\n8 ALREADY SOLD – DON'T WAIT – SECURE YOURS BEFORE THEY'RE GONE!\r\n\r\nWhether you're a first-home buyer, professional couple, downsizer, or savvy investor, this is an opportunity worth seeing.\r\n\r\n• CCC & TITLES ISSUED – READY TO MOVE IN!\r\n• LOVE THE VIEW. ENJOY THE PRIVACY. LIVE THE DIFFERENCE.\r\n\r\n“Don't wait until it's gone! Contact us today and secure your viewing.”\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
